-b1f9-4c41-8f06-7c7d66b60931\" />\r\nScaling size is in world space like orginally.\r\nI think the only big issue left is calculating the extents for selection properly. Right now it can be tricky to select the marker from anywhere other than its center. Might need some help with that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4482232506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]